\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Life of ages, richly poured,
\par Love of God, unspent and free,
\par Flowing in the prophet's word,
\par And the people's liberty.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Never was to chosen race
\par That unstinted tide confined:
\par Thine are every time and place,
\par Fountain sweet of heart and mind:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Breathing in the thinker's creed,
\par Pulsing in the hero's blood,
\par Nerving noblest thought and deed,
\par Freshening time with truth and good:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Consecrating art and song,
\par Holy book and pilgrim way,
\par Quelling strife and tyrant wrong,
\par Widening freedom's sacred sway.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Life of ages, richly poured,
\par Love of God, unspent and free,
\par Flowing in the prophet's word,
\par And the people's liberty.
\par \f1 
